Full-time', 'Mumbai', 'Full Time', '1 day ago', '2026-04-05 16:15:23.816127+00', 'https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4392878661/', '<p>About the job</p> <p>This is a Contract Role of 12 Months and can later change to Full time Permanent. BGV will be done so kindly do not apply if you are looking for Parallel working / Moonlighting.</p> <p>We are looking for Immediate joiners only!!!</p> <p>Job Title - SAP Data Migration Consultant</p> <p>Location - Remote</p> <p>Requirements: -</p> <p>4+ years in SAP projects with strong focus on data migration and/or integration. Solid understanding of SAP data objects and dependencies in MM, SD, FI/CO (and PP/EWM if relevant). Very strong Excel and data analysis skills (lookups, pivots, complex formulas). Comfortable liaising with both business and technical teams. Good understanding of retail / grocery data specifics (preferred)</p> <p>Key Responsibilities:-</p> <p>Own the functional side of data migration: scope, mapping, business rules, and sign-off criteria. Create and maintain mapping files (legacy → SAP) for master and transactional data across modules. Work with business data owners on cleansing and enrichment activities. Plan and support trial loads with the SAP partner; validate results and log issues. Perform detailed reconciliation between legacy and SAP data for quantities and values. Support integration testing for key flows: POS → SAP, WMS/EWM → SAP, legacy apps → SAP. Help define and execute cutover data steps (freeze dates, delta loads, final reconciliation). During go-live and hypercare, monitor data-related incidents and coordinate fixes. Document data migration and integration lessons learned and hand over to the client''s permanent IT/BI team</p> <p></p>', 'linkedin', '{"sync_date": "2026-04-05T17:01:56.248786+00:00"}', '''12'':16 ''4'':59 ''across'':145 ''activ'':156 ''analysi'':93 ''and/or'':70 ''app'':194 ''appli'':34 ''bgv'':26 ''busi'':103,126,149 ''chang'':21 ''cleans'':153 ''client'':235 ''comfort'':99 '