Internship', 'Bangalore', 'Internship', '3 hours ago', '2026-04-05 16:15:23.816127+00', 'https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4397537802/', '<p>About the job</p> <p>Company Description</p> <p>Join Biology Career Insights (BCI) as a Social Media Intern! 🎬</p> <p>Biology Career Insights (BCI) is a growing platform and podcast exploring the dynamic world of life sciences and biotechnology. Through conversations with scientists, founders, investors, and industry leaders, we bridge the gap between academic training and real-world careers, sharing insights, stories, and practical advice to help you thrive in biotech.</p> <p>Now, we’re looking for a creative and detail-oriented Social Media Intern (Video Editing focus) to join our team!</p> <p>🔹 Role: Social Media Intern</p> <p>🔹 Location: Remote (India)</p> <h3>🔹 Content:</h3> <ul><li>Long-form: Podcasts & interviews</li></ul> <ul><li>Short-form: Reels, Shorts & social clips</li></ul> <h3>🔹 Tools:</h3> <p>Adobe Premiere Pro, Final Cut Pro, Canva (or similar)</p> <p>🔹 Start Date: ASAP</p> <h3>✨ What You’ll Do:</h3> <ul><li>Edit engaging video content for social media</li></ul> <ul><li>Transform long-form podcast footage into high-impact short clips</li></ul> <ul><li>Collaborate with a fast-paced, creative content team</li></ul> <ul><li>Help grow and shape BCI’s digital presence</li></ul> <p>If you’re passionate about visual storytelling, content creation, and biotech conversations, this is a great opportunity to build your portfolio while working on meaningful content.</p> <p>👉 Know someone who’d love this? Tag them!</p> <p>📩 Apply now!</p> <p>#Hiring #VideoEditor #Internship #RemoteWork #CreativeJobs #PodcastEditing #ReelsEditor #BiotechCareers #ContentCreation #BCI</p> <p></p> <p>Requirements added by the job poster</p> <ul><li>Can start immediately</li></ul>', 'linkedin', '{"sync_date": "2026-04-05T17:01:56.248786+00:00"}', '''academ'':54 ''ad'':214 ''adob'':115 ''advic'':66 ''appli'':201 ''asap'':126 ''bci'':15,24,163,21